s and recipes',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(390,'### USAGE: .learn all default [<player>]\nTeaches the specified player, or target/self, all default spells for their race/class, as well as any quests they have unlocked through quests.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(391,'### USAGE: .learn all languages\nTeaches all available languages.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(392,'### USAGE: .learn all recipes <profession>\nTeaches all recipes for the given profession.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(393,'### USAGE: .learn all talents\nUnlocks all talents for the player\'s class.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(394,'### USAGE: .learn all pettalents\nUnlocks all talents for the player\'s pet.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(883,'Account',NULL,NULL,'Um einzutreten, müsst Ihr folgende Erfolg(e) erzielen:',NULL,NULL,'Para entrar, debes completar el/los siguiente(s) logro(s):','Para entrar, debes completar el/los siguiente(s) logro(s):',NULL),(884,'Objective %u not found.',NULL,NULL,'Um einzutreten, müsst Ihr folgende(n) Gegenstand/Gegenstände in Eurem Inventar haben:',NULL,NULL,'Para entrar, debes tener el/los siguiente(s) objeto(s) en tu inventario:','Para entrar, debes tener el/los siguiente(s) objeto(s) en tu inventario:',NULL),(1517,'Quest ID %u does not exist.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(5089,'Template StringID: %.*sSpawn StringID: %.*s\nScript StringID: %.*s',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(17000,'Player |cff00ff00%s|r Chat Cencured : |cffff0000%s','플레이어 |cff00ff00%s|r 채팅 검열 : |cffff0000%s','Joueur |cff00ff00%s|r chat censuré : |cffff0000%s','Spieler |cff00ff00%s|r Chat zensiert : |cffff0000%s','玩家 |cff00ff00%s|r 聊天已屏蔽 : |cffff0000%s','玩家 |cff00ff00%s|r 聊天已屏蔽 : |cffff0000%s','Jugador |cff00ff00%s|r chat censurado : |cffff0000%s','Jugador |cff00ff00%s|r chat censurado : |cffff0000%s','Игрок |cff00ff00%s|r чат отфильтрован : |cffff0000%s'),(882,'Ã¢â€â€š Map: %s, Zone: %s, Area: %s',